
👽 test linux/amd64

[EXPERIMENTAL]

Outputs environment variables for the assumed identity, suitable for use by external tools such as Terraform or Helm.

USAGE


    $ atmos auth env [flags]


FLAGS

  -f, --format string        Output format: bash, dotenv, env, github, json, credential-process (default bash)

  -h, --help                 help for env

      --login                Trigger authentication if credentials are missing or expired

      --min-validity string  Minimum remaining validity to reuse cached credentials (credential-process format only)
                             (default 15m)

  -o, --output-file string   Output file path (default: stdout, or $GITHUB_ENV for github format)



Use --help=usage for examples or --help=all for all flags and full help.
